/mockups/

# `screen -L` transcript from running the dev servers locally.
/screenlog.*

# Local coding-agent scratch. Never source, and never publishable from an
# aws-samples repository. It also has to stay ignored because the Workshop
# Studio release rule rejects any dirty source worktree, so one stray report
# here blocks a repin.
/.impeccable/
/docs/superpowers/

# Media-generation prompt drafts. The machine-readable inputs the scripts
# actually read are version-controlled under data/media/; these were the
# human-facing prompt dumps beside them, regenerated per batch rather than
# reviewed. Listed one by one on purpose: a `*-prompts*.md` glob also catches
# docs/hnsw-focused-product-prompts.md, which scripts/build_asset_labels.py and
# tests/test_media_assets.py both read.
/docs/category-plate-prompts.md
/docs/image-prompts-category-plates.md
/docs/image-generation-guide.md
/docs/media-generation-batches.md
